  <jpcrp_cor:ClassesOfSharesEtcTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant">【株式の種類等】　会社法第155条第７号による普通株式の取得</jpcrp_cor:ClassesOfSharesEtcTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:AcquisitionsByResolutionOfShareholdersMeetingTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant">
